+     ``solve_provenance_note``.
+  2. ``results/experiment_307_jepa_real_training.json`` had ``inference_mode`` flipped
+     ``live_gpu`` -> ``cpu_training``.
+  3. ``results/experiment_1035_dualgpu_rocm_v3.json`` had its run timestamps rewritten.
